# Model `DynamicZone` traversal as aggregate child-trigger occupancy

Model `DynamicZone` traversal as aggregate child-trigger occupancy. The first
child-volume entry of an occupancy episode emits the Dyna transition,
overlapping child volumes do not retrigger it, final exit rearms the zone, and
exit does not invert the transition. Each emitted step retains exact locator
and source-package identity; traversal order and geometry remain
caller-observed evidence.

